{"h":3406,"w":2400,"lines":[{"h":0.014679976512037562,"c":1,"w":0.063917522430419926,"y":0.047856723351194619,"x":0.068041238685379146,"t":"Test 4"},{"t":"Often, it is only the estrangement of foreign tongues, with their many exotic and outlandish","c":1,"w":0.83092783610026033,"h":0.017441861012089777,"y":0.097383720654560135,"x":0.11340206122873706},{"t":"features, that brings home the wonder of language's design. One of the showiest stunts that","y":0.11479741606844607,"c":1,"h":0.017615971814445186,"x":0.1113402192064863,"w":0.8268040974934896},{"t":"some languages can pull off is an ability to build up words of breath-breaking length, and","x":0.11340206005422138,"y":0.1335877862582685,"c":1,"w":0.80824742635091151,"h":0.017615971814445186},{"y":0.15261627879313233,"h":0.017441861012089777,"x":0.11340207044317434,"c":1,"t":"thus express in one word what English takes a whole sentence to say. The Turkish word","w":0.78969070434570321},{"t":"şehirliliştiremediklerimizdensiniz, to take one example, means nothing less thaniỊạyou are","w":0.79793813069661457,"y":0.16999412821113702,"c":1,"x":0.11134021945581632,"h":0.019083969465648831},{"c":1,"t":"one of those whom we can't turn into a town-dweller? (In case you were wondering, this","y":0.18704804188480406,"w":0.80018524169921867,"x":0.11332181245363435,"h":0.021018677295409294},{"x":0.11340205094651309,"y":0.20784883704612811,"h":0.018895349149765539,"t":"monstrosity really is one word, not merely many different words squashed together - most of","c":1,"w":0.84948455810546875},{"t":"its components cannot even stand up on their own.)","y":0.22812683488432861,"x":0.11340206402465673,"h":0.014679976512037562,"c":1,"w":0.47628865559895833},{"x":0.11340205310124835,"c":1,"t":"And if that sounds like some one-off freak, then consider Sumerian, the language spoken","h":0.017441861012089666,"y":0.26598837181716029,"w":0.81030929565429677},{"x":0.11340206855474927,"t":"on the banks of the Euphrates some 5,000 years ago by the people who invented writing","y":0.28479154408302865,"c":1,"h":0.017615971814445075,"w":0.79793813069661468},{"t":"and thus enabled the documentation of history. A Sumerian word like munintuma'a (when","x":0.11134021237503039,"h":0.015988371754420694,"y":0.30377906993463388,"w":0.82886596679687496,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.019772231123829642,"w":0.82078623453776034,"y":0.3203807674862551,"t":"he had made it suitable for heriỊi might seem rather trim compared to the Turkish colossus","x":0.11331193930859892},{"t":"above. What is so impressive about it, however, is not its lengthiness but rather the reverse","y":0.33998825627676932,"h":0.017615971814445075,"x":0.11134021419972802,"c":1,"w":0.8206185404459635},{"w":0.81237111409505214,"h":0.017441861012089777,"x":0.10927836037814652,"c":1,"y":0.35901162763118899,"t":"- the thrifty compactness of its construction. The word is made up of different slots, each"},{"w":0.8082474263509114,"c":1,"t":"corresponding to a particular portion of meaning. This sleek design allows single sounds","h":0.016147974163241319,"x":0.11134020425961998,"y":0.37786259549564205},{"h":0.021460162984295872,"t":"to convey useful information, and in fact even the absence of a sound has been enlisted to","x":0.1112345640614069,"y":0.39279461732900622,"w":0.81877182006835947,"c":1},{"y":0.41424418576998612,"x":0.11134019379672376,"w":0.82680414835611982,"h":0.017441861012089888,"c":1,"t":"express something specific. If you were to ask which bit in the Sumerian word corresponds"},{"c":1,"h":0.019083969465648942,"t":"to the pronoun 'it' in the English translationwhen he had made it suitable for her' then the","x":0.11340205442133111,"y":0.43159130947675939,"w":0.83298970540364592},{"w":0.82886596679687519,"x":0.11134021238621311,"y":0.45203488344482468,"h":0.017441861012089777,"c":1,"t":"answer would have to be nothing. Mind you, a very particular kind of nothing: the nothing"},{"c":1,"t":"that stands in the empty slot in the middle. The technology is so fine-tuned then that even a","y":0.46946564869566609,"w":0.83298970540364581,"h":0.017452956225965766,"x":0.11340205439909387},{"h":0.017615971814445075,"y":0.48825601887906167,"t":"non-sound, when carefully placed in a particular position, has been invested with a specific","x":0.11134019875228177,"c":1,"w":0.83298970540364581},{"t":"function. Who could possibly have come up with such a nifty contraption?","w":0.68041239420572919,"c":1,"h":0.017441861012089777,"y":0.50726744158431958,"x":0.11134019454661996},{"y":0.95348837196844649,"w":0.026804122924804684,"h":0.013081395479069058,"c":1,"x":0.059793814723164661,"t":"98"},{"w":0.29146728515625003,"h":0.022590341528793467,"x":0.35215565856554271,"y":0.95433050061023428,"c":1,"t":"leltsresources.org"}]}